    "%@ can install these dependencies again from %@. To restore them, run %@ in the project folder. Moppo does not select vendor folders automatically. Review this folder before removal.": {
      "comment": "Removal or protection guidance. Preserve what remains protected, which data is shared, and all literal paths and commands.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ can install these dependencies again from %@. To restore them, run %@ in the project folder. Moppo does not select vendor folders automatically. Review this folder before removal."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ può installare di nuovo queste dipendenze da %2$@. Per ripristinarle, esegui %3$@ nella cartella del progetto. Moppo non seleziona automaticamente le cartelle vendor. Controlla questa cartella prima di rimuoverla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ peut réinstaller ces dépendances à partir de %2$@. Pour les restaurer, exécutez %3$@ dans le dossier du projet. Moppo ne sélectionne pas les dossiers vendor automatiquement. Vérifiez ce dossier avant de le supprimer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ puede reinstalar estas dependencias desde %2$@. Para restaurarlas, ejecuta %3$@ en la carpeta del proyecto. Moppo no selecciona automáticamente las carpetas vendor. Revisa esta carpeta antes de eliminarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
