    "Codex permanently deletes the selected conversation history and related session files. This also deletes %lld child sessions. This includes messages, tool results, and images stored in the history. Credentials, settings, and separate attachment, image, and memory folders stay protected. This deletion does not use the Trash and cannot be undone.": {
      "comment": "Removal or recovery guidance. The Trash refers to the macOS Trash. Preserve the removal conditions and any file paths.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex permanently deletes the selected conversation history and related session files. This also deletes %lld child session. This includes messages, tool results, and images stored in the history. Credentials, settings, and separate attachment, image, and memory folders stay protected. This deletion does not use the Trash and cannot be undone."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex permanently deletes the selected conversation history and related session files. This also deletes %lld child sessions. This includes messages, tool results, and images stored in the history. Credentials, settings, and separate attachment, image, and memory folders stay protected. This deletion does not use the Trash and cannot be undone."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex elimina definitivamente la cronologia delle conversazioni selezionate e i relativi file di sessione. Elimina anche %lld sessione figlia. La rimozione include i messaggi, i risultati degli strumenti e le immagini nella cronologia. Le credenziali, le impostazioni e le cartelle separate di allegati, immagini e memorie restano protette. La rimozione non usa il Cestino e non può essere annullata."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex elimina definitivamente la cronologia delle conversazioni selezionate e i relativi file di sessione. Elimina anche %lld sessioni figlie. La rimozione include i messaggi, i risultati degli strumenti e le immagini nella cronologia. Le credenziali, le impostazioni e le cartelle separate di allegati, immagini e memorie restano protette. La rimozione non usa il Cestino e non può essere annullata."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex supprime définitivement l’historique des conversations sélectionnées et les fichiers de session associés. La suppression concerne aussi %lld session enfant. La suppression inclut les messages, les résultats des outils et les images stockées dans l’historique. Les identifiants, les réglages et les dossiers de pièces jointes, d’images et de mémoires restent protégés. Cette suppression ne passe pas par la corbeille et ne peut pas être annulée."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex supprime définitivement l’historique des conversations sélectionnées et les fichiers de session associés. La suppression concerne aussi %lld sessions enfants. La suppression inclut les messages, les résultats des outils et les images stockées dans l’historique. Les identifiants, les réglages et les dossiers de pièces jointes, d’images et de mémoires restent protégés. Cette suppression ne passe pas par la corbeille et ne peut pas être annulée."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex elimina de forma permanente el historial de las conversaciones seleccionadas y los archivos de sesión asociados. También elimina %lld sesión secundaria. La eliminación incluye los mensajes, los resultados de las herramientas y las imágenes del historial. Las credenciales, los ajustes y las carpetas separadas de archivos adjuntos, imágenes y memorias siguen protegidos. La eliminación no usa la Papelera y no puede deshacerse."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Codex elimina de forma permanente el historial de las conversaciones seleccionadas y los archivos de sesión asociados. También elimina %lld sesiones secundarias. La eliminación incluye los mensajes, los resultados de las herramientas y las imágenes del historial. Las credenciales, los ajustes y las carpetas separadas de archivos adjuntos, imágenes y memorias siguen protegidos. La eliminación no usa la Papelera y no puede deshacerse."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex permanently deletes the selected conversation history and related session files. This includes messages, tool results, and images stored in the history. Credentials, settings, and separate attachment, image, and memory folders stay protected. This deletion does not use the Trash and cannot be undone.": {
      "comment": "Removal or recovery guidance. The Trash refers to the macOS Trash. Preserve the removal conditions and any file paths.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex permanently deletes the selected conversation history and related session files. This includes messages, tool results, and images stored in the history. Credentials, settings, and separate attachment, image, and memory folders stay protected. This deletion does not use the Trash and cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex elimina definitivamente la cronologia delle conversazioni selezionate e i relativi file di sessione. La rimozione include i messaggi, i risultati degli strumenti e le immagini nella cronologia. Le credenziali, le impostazioni e le cartelle separate di allegati, immagini e memorie restano protette. La rimozione non usa il Cestino e non può essere annullata."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex supprime définitivement l’historique des conversations sélectionnées et les fichiers de session associés. La suppression inclut les messages, les résultats des outils et les images stockées dans l’historique. Les identifiants, les réglages et les dossiers de pièces jointes, d’images et de mémoires restent protégés. Cette suppression ne passe pas par la corbeille et ne peut pas être annulée."
          }
        },
        "es": {
