    "Older Xcode versions can have this simulator deletion issue. Apple lists a fix in Xcode 27.2. If you use an older version, update Xcode before you retry removal in Xcode Components.": {
      "comment": "Scan result or progress text. Preserve product names, file paths, and commands.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Older Xcode versions can have this simulator deletion issue. Apple lists a fix in Xcode 27.2. If you use an older version, update Xcode before you retry removal in Xcode Components."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le versioni meno recenti di Xcode possono avere questo problema con la rimozione del simulatore. Apple indica una correzione in Xcode 27.2. Se usi una versione precedente, aggiorna Xcode prima di riprovare la rimozione in Components in Xcode."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les anciennes versions de Xcode peuvent présenter ce problème de suppression du simulateur. Apple indique un correctif dans Xcode 27.2. Si vous utilisez une version antérieure, mettez Xcode à jour avant de réessayer dans Components dans Xcode."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las versiones anteriores de Xcode pueden tener este problema al eliminar el simulador. Apple indica una corrección en Xcode 27.2. Si usas una versión anterior, actualiza Xcode antes de volver a intentar la eliminación en Components, en Xcode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
